{"4080150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Y.E.L.L.", "steam_appid": 4080150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Y.E.L.L.</strong> the loudest multiplayer brawl on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your animal fighter entirely with your voice: run, jump, shoot, and scream your way to glory in physics-based arenas where chaos reigns and microphones tremble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite dumb hero: Pug, Goat, Dodo, or Pigeon, and blast your friends to pieces using only your vocal power. No buttons. No controllers. Just pure, unfiltered noise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice-Controlled Madness: Move, aim, and attack by yelling. Volume, pitch, or even nonsense words — it all works.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stupidly Adorable Characters: From angry goats to unhinged pigeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive Arenas: Just a big mess. Nothing makes sense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer &amp; Bots: Scream at friends or terrorize AI opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to Learn, Hard to Shut Up: Every match is unpredictable, every yell unique.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Y.E.L.L.</strong> the loudest multiplayer brawl on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your animal fighter entirely with your voice: run, jump, shoot, and scream your way to glory in physics-based arenas where chaos reigns and microphones tremble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite dumb hero: Pug, Goat, Dodo, or Pigeon, and blast your friends to pieces using only your vocal power. No buttons. No controllers. Just pure, unfiltered noise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice-Controlled Madness: Move, aim, and attack by yelling. Volume, pitch, or even nonsense words — it all works.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stupidly Adorable Characters: From angry goats to unhinged pigeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive Arenas: Just a big mess. Nothing makes sense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer &amp; Bots: Scream at friends or terrorize AI opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to Learn, Hard to Shut Up: Every match is unpredictable, every yell unique.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Scream to survive! In this chaotic voice-controlled brawler, yell instructions to move your dumb animal warrior. Battle friends or bots in explosive arenas where silence means death, and luck means victory!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080150/1eb385b13ea5dda20f082a85494ad306db271f79/header.jpg?t=1764338909", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080150/2b0ac7a2228b3cb0ff45dad1ad6f3c4c2743c6fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764338909", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080150/2b0ac7a2228b3cb0ff45dad1ad6f3c4c2743c6fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764338909", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I5 7th gen / AMD Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> gtx 700 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Sto